\\ test/test_macros.6502 - macros for any of make test's checks.

\\ Add A to a pair of Fletcher sums, mod 256.
\\
\\ Inputs:
\\     A: the byte
\\     sum1, sum2: the sums
\\
\\ Outputs:
\\     sum1, sum2: with it added

MACRO FLETCHER sum1, sum2
    CLC:ADC sum1:STA sum1
    CLC:ADC sum2:STA sum2
ENDMACRO
